WEBVTT

00:08.874 --> 00:12.364
The first train will soon be arriving at Platform 1.

00:13.244 --> 00:16.874
For your safety, please move back
and wait behind the white line.

00:36.064 --> 00:39.194
Something reached for but cannot be grasped...

00:40.774 --> 00:44.264
Something that strays from that hand,
going far away...

00:45.974 --> 00:50.344
People will always pursue such things.

00:51.314 --> 00:54.804
And before long, become lost.

01:00.794 --> 01:05.314
This is our story of one such summer.

