It costs so much...

04:07.444 --> 04:10.374
Crunch time
is Chance time!
Smiling faces at
Pachinko GOGO

04:31.434 --> 04:32.834
Welcome!

04:33.434 --> 04:34.904
May I take your order?

04:34.904 --> 04:37.134
Um...

04:37.344 --> 04:41.074
Right now you can order
from our breakfast menu.

04:51.824 --> 04:53.484
Have you decided?

04:57.994 --> 04:59.224
Won't You Join
Our Team?

04:59.224 --> 05:00.994
Won't You Join
Our Team?
Yes, please!

05:01.264 --> 05:03.134
My name is Karada lokawa!

05:03.134 --> 05:04.634
Cooking is my specialty!

05:04.634 --> 05:05.664
You don't say.

05:05.664 --> 05:09.304
I've never made a hamburger before. But...

05:09.304 --> 05:14.574
But I will study very hard!
Please let me work here!

05:14.574 --> 05:16.444
So, Ms. Iokawa?

05:16.444 --> 05:17.344
Yes?!

05:17.344 --> 05:18.874
Did you bring a resume?

05:21.814 --> 05:23.584
Resume?

05:29.454 --> 05:31.554
A resume, huh?

05:33.424 --> 05:34.584
I'll do my best!

05:35.334 --> 05:37.924
Resume, resume, resume!

05:38.864 --> 05:42.734
Um... resume!

05:45.474 --> 05:49.114
Excuse me! Do you have any resumes?

05:49.114 --> 05:51.544
Down there, on the bottom shelf.

05:59.024 --> 06:00.954
Resume
Templates

06:02.924 --> 06:04.224
Thank you very much.

06:10.504 --> 06:12.094
Um!

06:19.144 --> 06:21.304
Looking for Sales Staff
If you've got the drive...
won't you join our team?

06:21.914 --> 06:23.674
Let's see here...

06:24.744 --> 06:26.514
How do you read this?

06:26.814 --> 06:30.254
"Lokawa"! Karada lokawa!

06:30.254 --> 06:32.854
I love books! Thank you very much!

06:32.854 --> 06:34.694
You need to write how your name's pronounced.

06:34.694 --> 06:35.524
I'm sorry?

06:35.524 --> 06:36.954
There's no picture attached either.

06:36.954 --> 06:38.024
Picture?

06:38.024 --> 06:39.684
Also...

06:40.194 --> 06:44.254
You don't usually write a resume
in PENCIL, do you?

06:45.264 --> 06:46.464
Huh?

06:46.464 --> 06:48.094
Is there something else?

06:50.274 --> 06:52.004
You're 12 years old?

06:59.314 --> 07:00.614
I'll do my best!

07:07.854 --> 07:10.054
Please ensure that the area from your
hair to your chin

07:10.054 --> 07:13.354
fits within the oval appearing on the screen.

07:13.694 --> 07:14.624
Okay!

07:21.804 --> 07:23.034
Picture, check!

07:27.644 --> 07:31.974
"How to write a resume that
showcases your appeal," huh?

07:32.414 --> 07:35.614
Um, "Your resume is very important.

07:35.614 --> 07:39.554
"Once you've finished filling it in, make sure
that there's nothing you've overlooked."

07:46.324 --> 07:48.834
How to Write
a Resume

07:48.834 --> 07:51.304
Resume
HANAKO S ATO

07:51.304 --> 07:53.304
Eatery
Miho-chan

07:53.304 --> 07:53.464
Resume August 21, 2006
Ha na ko S ato
DOB April 5, 1986 (20 yrs old)

07:53.464 --> 07:55.874
Resume August 21, 2006
Ha na ko S ato
DOB April 5, 1986 (20 yrs old)
Hanako Sato, 20.

07:55.874 --> 07:56.404
Resume August 21, 2006
Ha na ko S ato
DOB April 5, 1986 (20 yrs old)
Yes!

07:56.404 --> 07:56.774
Yes!

07:57.004 --> 08:00.044
I'm always cooking, so that's my specialty!

08:00.044 --> 08:01.644
You live by yourself?

08:01.644 --> 08:02.914
N-no.

08:02.914 --> 08:06.744
I lost my parents in an accident
when I was young,

08:06.744 --> 08:10.044
and since then I've lived with
my older brother, so...

08:12.184 --> 08:13.384
Um...

08:13.384 --> 08:18.164
You're hired! Youngsters these days
will just quit without a second thought,

08:18.164 --> 08:21.564
but you seem like the type
who'd work hard for us!

08:21.564 --> 08:23.754
Huh? Really?!

08:25.364 --> 08:28.474
The most important thing for this job
is a sense of commitment.

08:28.474 --> 08:30.604
Yes, ma'am! I'll do my best!

08:30.604 --> 08:32.574
All right, I'll get in touch with you later.

08:32.574 --> 08:33.444
I'm sorry?

08:33.444 --> 08:39.344
The thing is, I'm just the manager.
I have to run it by the owner.

08:41.214 --> 08:42.704
Oh...

08:58.334 --> 09:01.924
Realtor

09:24.264 --> 09:26.384
I'm so hungry.

09:27.634 --> 09:29.464
Hey there, you free?

09:29.964 --> 09:30.864
Excuse me?

09:30.864 --> 09:33.034
If so, you wanna go hang out?

09:33.034 --> 09:34.434
We can do karaoke or something.

09:34.734 --> 09:38.174
You've been sittin' here a while, huh?
I've been watching.

09:38.604 --> 09:40.544
You're not doin' anything, right?

09:40.544 --> 09:42.514
C'mon, let's go!

09:42.514 --> 09:43.914
U-um...

09:43.914 --> 09:46.084
We can go somewhere more fun if you want.

09:46.084 --> 09:47.044
Excuse me!

09:47.044 --> 09:48.254
What the hell's your problem?!

09:48.254 --> 09:49.614
Wait up!

09:50.054 --> 09:52.544
You think you can get away from us?!

09:54.094 --> 09:56.184
Hey, wait!

09:57.824 --> 09:59.564
Hey! Wait, I said!

09:59.564 --> 10:01.464
Don't run away!

10:04.904 --> 10:08.104
Hey there, Cutie. Where are you from?

10:08.104 --> 10:12.334
You need some money, don't you?
You're in some kinda trouble.

10:14.144 --> 10:16.574
If you're lookin' for a job,
I can introduce you to some people.

10:20.714 --> 10:23.414
A cute girl like you could make some cash.

10:23.414 --> 10:26.354
If you like, I can even show you a place to stay.

10:26.454 --> 10:27.444
No!

10:28.224 --> 10:30.624
There's places that pay out daily, if you want!

10:31.724 --> 10:33.784
Watch where yer goin', dammit!

11:19.104 --> 11:20.934
I'll do my best...

11:48.604 --> 11:50.504
Get ready, Karada!

11:50.744 --> 11:52.034
Here!

11:59.814 --> 12:01.784
Sorry 'bout that, Karada.

12:11.424 --> 12:15.054
Look here, Karada. This is your big brother.

12:15.394 --> 12:17.434
Your brother is far, far away,

12:17.434 --> 12:21.194
across the ocean in a country called "America".

12:25.704 --> 12:27.744
My big brother?

12:27.744 --> 12:29.044
That's right.

12:29.444 --> 12:32.474
And if you're a good girl, you'll meet him soon.

12:41.294 --> 12:45.884
Honey... Is it really all right
to keep Karada in the dark like this?

12:47.364 --> 12:49.334
How could we possibly tell her?

12:50.804 --> 12:53.894
That she's not really our child...

13:09.714 --> 13:11.084
Karada!

13:11.084 --> 13:16.724
Dad, Mom... You're not my real dad and mom?

13:16.724 --> 13:21.324
I'm sorry for not telling you, Karada. I'm sorry.

13:25.264 --> 13:29.934
My dad and mom came to love me even more...

13:30.434 --> 13:33.374
But there was one thing that worried me:

13:33.704 --> 13:38.844
Would my big brother in America
think of me as his sister?

13:39.414 --> 13:42.814
"Nice to meet you, Big Brother.
I'm Karada lokawa."

13:42.814 --> 13:43.154
CONGRATULATIONS!

13:43.154 --> 13:43.214
CONGRATULATIONS!
That's what I'll say when I first meet him.

13:43.214 --> 13:45.754
That's what I'll say when I first meet him.

13:45.754 --> 13:50.314
I repeated those words in my mind,
over and over again.

15:23.684 --> 15:25.014
Um...

15:28.954 --> 15:32.954
P-pleased to meet you. I'm Karada lokawa.

15:33.624 --> 15:34.924
Big Brother!

15:45.004 --> 15:47.804
I'm sorry I got here so late.

15:48.444 --> 15:50.844
But it's all right now.

15:51.414 --> 15:53.604
B-Big Brother?

15:54.214 --> 15:55.544
Yes.

15:56.914 --> 15:58.624
Big Brother!

15:58.624 --> 15:59.614
Yes.

16:05.864 --> 16:07.564
Big Brother!

16:07.564 --> 16:08.684
Yes.

16:12.164 --> 16:14.104
Big Brother!

16:14.104 --> 16:17.434
Big Brother! Big Brother!

16:31.884 --> 16:34.354
As of today, this is our new apartment.

16:40.464 --> 16:42.434
IOKAWA Hiro
Karada

16:52.274 --> 16:53.604
Ow!

17:08.624 --> 17:10.094
Karada!

17:10.094 --> 17:12.524
That's too dangerous for a child to be doing!

17:12.524 --> 17:15.124
L-I'm all right!

17:21.634 --> 17:24.074
Well, let's cook together.

17:25.774 --> 17:26.794
Okay!

17:36.654 --> 17:38.054
Hiro?

17:38.054 --> 17:39.284
What is it?

17:39.654 --> 17:42.414
What's America like?

17:46.694 --> 17:48.124
I forget.

17:52.264 --> 17:54.994
But I knew.

17:55.134 --> 17:59.304
Hiro had sacrificed so much for me.

17:59.904 --> 18:04.774
Something that was very important.
That's why I made my wish.

18:04.914 --> 18:10.114
I wanted to be a grown-up, right now,
so that Hiro could be free from me.

18:10.584 --> 18:12.074
But...

18:12.554 --> 18:16.654
My wish hasn't made anyone happy at all.

18:29.204 --> 18:34.004
Vacant

18:42.314 --> 18:44.184
Hey, are you all right?

18:45.684 --> 18:47.914
You were here yesterday morning too,
weren't you?

18:51.624 --> 18:53.394
Wait just a minute.

19:06.304 --> 19:07.774
A resume?

19:08.574 --> 19:11.234
Karada Gohyakukawa?

19:22.624 --> 19:25.094
You still had these?

19:26.224 --> 19:29.454
I forgot. I'm sorry.

19:35.704 --> 19:38.224
Hello? Karada?!

19:41.574 --> 19:43.774
Huh? "Gohyakukawa"?

19:44.314 --> 19:46.374
No, this is the lokawa household.

20:28.724 --> 20:30.314
Hiro!

20:34.764 --> 20:38.164
What Hiro really sacrificed was...

21:00.554 --> 21:01.644
Karada!

21:19.304 --> 21:20.504
Karada!

21:21.044 --> 21:22.944
Come back! Karada!

21:23.214 --> 21:24.804
Come back!

21:27.214 --> 21:28.374
Karada!

21:35.994 --> 21:37.614
I'm sorry.

21:53.074 --> 21:54.504
Karada...

22:00.284 --> 22:02.474
Thank you.

22:02.854 --> 22:07.914
Thank you for always, always
being there as my big brother.

22:13.864 --> 22:20.104
Narenai kutsu wo haita

22:20.104 --> 22:24.834
Ippozutsu taeru itami

22:26.274 --> 22:32.544
Soredemo aruku no wa

22:32.544 --> 22:37.344
Kaeru basho ga aru kara

22:38.124 --> 22:46.264
Watashi ga watashi wo mitsumete

22:46.264 --> 22:50.854
Kizuita wasuremono

22:54.004 --> 23:00.174
Anato to issho ni itai

23:00.174 --> 23:06.884
Chikaku de, tooku de kanjitai yo

23:06.884 --> 23:12.754
Atarimae no mainichi

23:12.754 --> 23:19.394
Itoshii anato to tsukuritsuzukeru

23:19.394 --> 23:26.824
"Tadaima" to kutsu wo nuide, dakishimeru

23:27.064 --> 23:31.904
My sweet home

23:45.884 --> 23:49.824
In time, you came closer to me
than you were even back then.

23:50.624 --> 23:53.154
Though unable to meet, still we came together.

23:53.294 --> 23:55.594
Even without speaking,
we understood each other.

23:55.834 --> 23:58.524
This sense of comfort and... warmth.

23:59.604 --> 24:01.504
Once we'd lost it, we noticed:

24:01.634 --> 24:06.404
That which we'd encountered, that which
had bound us together was that girl.

24:07.644 --> 24:10.074
